<title>CANADA: Suzy Shier Ltd Q3 turns to profit.</title>
<headline>Suzy Shier Ltd Q3 turns to profit.</headline>
<dateline>MONTREAL 1996-11-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>third quarter ended Nov. 2</p>
<p>			    1996			    1995</p>
<p> Shr	 profit	C$0.12     loss	C$0.05</p>
<p> Net	 profit	 1,517     loss	   659</p>
<p> Revs			72,796		  187,659</p>
<p>	    9 MONTHS</p>
<p> Shr	 profit	C$3.08     loss	C$0.34</p>
<p> Net	 profit	39,253     loss	 4,044</p>
<p> Revs		     354,168		  321,408</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)  </p>
<p>NOTE:Suzy Shier said its 1996 quarterly results included a</p>
<p>C$1.2 million, or C$0.09 per share, non-recurring gain</p>
<p>from the partial sale of an investment.</p>
<p>	  -- Reuters Toronto Bureau (416) 941-8100</p>
